 "text": "Treasurer' Office\nSkip to main content\nSelect Language ​ ▼\ntranslate\nEnglish\nAfrikaans\nAlbanian\nArabic\nArmenian\nAzerbaijani\nBasque\nBelarusian\nBengali\nBosnian\nBulgarian\nCatalan\nCebuano\nChinese (Simplified)\nChinese (Traditional)\nCroatian\nCzech\nDanish\nDutch\nEsperanto\nEstonian\nFilipino\nFinnish\nFrench\nGalician\nGeorgian\nGerman\nGreek\nGujarati\nHaitian Creole\nHausa\nHebrew\nHindi\nHmong\nHungarian\nIcelandic\nIgbo\nIndonesian\nIrish\nItalian\nJapanese\nJavanese\nKannada\nKhmer\nKorean\nLao\nLatin\nLatvian\nLithuanian\nMacedonian\nMalay\nMaltese\nMaori\nMarathi\nMongolian\nNepali\nNorwegian\nPersian\nPolish\nPortuguese\nPunjabi\nRomanian\nRussian\nSerbian\nSlovak\nSlovenian\nSomali\nSpanish\nSwahili\nSwedish\nTamil\nTelugu\nThai\nTurkish\nUkrainian\nUrdu\nVietnamese\nWelsh\nYiddish\nYoruba\nZulu\nPrint\nHome\nGovernment\nDepartments A-H\nAmbulance\nAssessor\nAuditor\nChild Support\nCircuit Court\nClerk / Election Board\nCommunity Corrections\nCoroner\nCounty Commissioners\nCounty Council\nEmergency Management\nExtension\nHealth Department\nHighway Department\nHuman Resources\nDepartments I-Z\nJuvenile Home\nPlanning & Zoning\nProbation Office\nProsecutor's Office\nPublic Defender\nRecorder\nSheriff's Department / Jail\nSuperior Court I\nSuperior Court II\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nVeteran's Office\nVisitor's Center\nI Want To\nApply for a Job\nSign up for Citizen Alerts\nContact the County\nPay Taxes\nReport a Problem\nView County Events\nView County Maps\nAbout Us\nCounty Maps\nDemographics\nEmployment Opportunities\nCalendar Events\nFAQs\nGeography\nHistory of Jackson County\nJackson County Township Trustees\nPhoto Archive\nMeeting Archive\nslide 1 of 1\nJackson County Treasurer\nSub Menu\nTreasurer\nJudgments\nMobile Home Permits\nProperty Tax Payments\nReal Estate Tax Sale\nFrequently Asked Questions\nPay My Taxes\nJackson County GIS\nQuick Reference of Property Tax Deductions\nHome\nGovernment\nDepartments I-Z\nTreasurer\nTreasurer' Office\nProperty Tax Research Web Site:\nhttps://lowtaxinfo.com/jacksoncounty\nPay Taxes Online at:\nhttps://billpay.forte.net/jacksoncointax/\nThe county treasurer is an elected official that serves a four year term and may not exceed two consecutive terms. The treasurer’s office maintains checking accounts\nheld by the county and also invests monies on available county funds. The office of the treasurer receives information needed for property tax calculation and tax statements that are then issued to each taxpayer\nThe treasurer's duties also include:\nClearing Liquor licenses\nClearing the moving mobile homes / transferring titles for mobile homes\nCollecting and distributing the innkeepers' tax\nProcessing bankruptcy claims\nReconciling bank checking accounts held by the county\nMaintaining a monthly ledger and financial statement\nCollecting property taxes\nServing as secretary to the County Board of Finance\nOffice Hours\nThe Jackson County treasurer's office is open from 8:00 am until 4:30 pm, Monday through Friday. The office is closed on holidays designated by the Jackson County Board of Commissioners .\nJackson County Treasurer's Office\n111 S. Main St. Suite 124\nBrownstown, IN 47220\nJackson County Treasurer\nKathy S. Hohenstreiter\n(812) 358-6125\nemail\nslide 1 to 5 of 7\nRecorder's\nOffice\nBoard of\nCommissioners\nClerk's\nOffice\nAuditor's\nOffice\nPlanning &\nZoning\nAssessor\nSurveyor's Office\nShare this page\nShare this page\n×\nCopy and paste this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://jacksoncounty.in.gov/government/departments_i-z/treasurer/index.php\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nReddit\nClose\nRESOURCES\nMeetings & Agendas\nJackson County GIS\nProperty Research\nE-Recording\nProperty Fraud Alert\nWhere do I Vote?\nSheriff's Department\nRESOURCES\nVoting Information\nZoning Ordinance\nSubdivision Control Ordinanace\nBuilding Permit Requirements\nPublic Document Center\nComprehensive Plan\nHistoric County Road Maps\nDIRECTORY\nAuditor\nAssessor\nClerk\nCommunity Corrections\nHighway Department\nPlanning & Zoning\nTreasurer\nSurveyor\n© Copyright Jackson County, Indiana ⋅ 111 S Main Street Brownstown, IN 47220 ⋅\n(812) 358-6161\nPowered by revize. the Government Website Experts. ⋅ LOGIN\nClose\nRead More\nOriginal text\nRate this translation\nYour feedback will be used to help improve Google Translate",
